{"parentUuid":"0458744c-0ace-40d1-b004-73f926a25946","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/Users/lukin/Neumann","sessionId":"f409b145-d62e-472d-b034-4de3a5b13ab9","version":"2.1.72","gitBranch":"publish-and-snapshot-improvements","slug":"mighty-hugging-umbrella","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01DVXAYYtUStkQN6pkXJcGeE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Two files changed. Here's a summary of the fixes:\n\n**Benchmark PR fix** (`.github/workflows/bench-pr.yml`):\n- Changed `--benches` to `--bench '*'` in both the base-branch and PR-branch benchmark steps. `--benches` includes lib targets (which use the built-in test harness that doesn't understand criterion's `--save-baseline`), while `--bench '*'` selects only named `[[bench]]` targets.\n\n**Fuzz consensus_conflict fix** (`tensor_store/src/sparse_vector.rs`):\n- Replaced `debug_assert_eq!` dimension checks with graceful early returns in 5 methods:\n  - `dot_f64()` → returns 0.0 (orthogonal)\n  - `dot_dense()` → returns 0.0\n  - `weighted_jaccard()` → returns 0.0\n  - `euclidean_distance_squared_f64()` → returns `f64::INFINITY` (clamped to `f32::MAX` by callers)\n  - `manhattan_distance()` → returns `f32::INFINITY`\n- Added 6 tests verifying the dimension mismatch behavior\n- Verified the original crash input (`OTk5KZlbWw==`) no longer panics\n\nWant me to commit and push these?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":169,"cache_read_input_tokens":76752,"output_tokens":321,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":169,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}},"requestId":"req_011CYwoW9wDmgdaJaAyRHQue","type":"assistant","uuid":"5269961c-3628-424a-a270-3c0ba73862cd","timestamp":"2026-03-11T18:56:15.001Z"}
